WEBVTT

00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:39.958
That's...

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:51.875
Mentor!

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:55.583
I always believed in you!

00:01:04.875 --> 00:01:06.417
Lady Alice...

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.042
"The Night Before Battle"

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:44.042
I just looked at the Eastern Gate.

00:02:44.042 --> 00:02:49.500
There's not much time before the gate's
destroyed and the enemy pushes through.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.500
The enemy army has about
50,000 troops. We have 3,000.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.208
We have to give them what training we can.

00:02:57.208 --> 00:02:59.625
Where are the other Integrity Knights?

00:02:59.625 --> 00:03:04.042
From above, I could only see seven outside.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.875
That's everyone.

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:09.125
That's ridiculous!

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:12.708
There should be 31 members
of the order, including me!

00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:14.708
Surely you're aware, Lady Alice.

00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:18.833
That Prime Senator Chudelkin
had been used a retuning art

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:21.792
on knights who showed symptoms
of memory issues.

00:03:21.792 --> 00:03:26.625
Ten of those knights have yet
to awaken from that art.

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:29.542
At this time, 21 knights are awake.

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:32.667
Four are watching over the
Cathedral and the capital,

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:36.042
and four are patrolling the End Mountains.

00:03:36.042 --> 00:03:39.042
That leaves 13.

00:03:39.042 --> 00:03:42.458
Our forces are already stretched too thin.

00:03:42.458 --> 00:03:44.375
And yet, Lady Alice...

00:03:45.542 --> 00:03:49.958
Do you intend to shield that
young man while you fight?

00:03:50.917 --> 00:03:53.417
Of course I do.

00:03:53.417 --> 00:03:55.208
Because I swore to protect him.

00:03:55.208 --> 00:03:56.667
You mustn't, Mentor!

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:59.375
Should you encumber yourself
with such deadweight in battle,

00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:04.750
not only will it diminish the power of your sword,
it could expose you to danger yourself!

00:04:07.167 --> 00:04:11.000
Well, don't get so worked up, Eldrie.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.542
Yo, little one.

00:04:12.542 --> 00:04:15.292
I'm relieved to see
you look better than I expected.

00:04:15.292 --> 00:04:17.583
Have your cheeks filled in a little?

00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:19.250
Uncle.

00:04:20.792 --> 00:04:22.750
It's been a long time.

00:04:25.292 --> 00:04:26.500
Commander--

00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:32.958
Uncle.

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:36.250
Is he going to kill Kirito?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.833
It's all right, little one.

00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:52.250
U-Uncle...

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.083
Little one, did you just see that?

00:04:55.083 --> 00:04:59.708
Yes. It was only for an instant,
but I definitely saw the flash of a sword.

00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:04.333
I launched an Incarnate Sword,
or rather, a dagger at that young man.

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:08.125
If it had hit, it would've
sliced some skin off his cheek.

00:05:08.125 --> 00:05:11.583
If it had... hit? Which means...

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:14.208
That's right. He stopped it.

00:05:14.208 --> 00:05:16.958
With his own willpower.

00:05:21.458 --> 00:05:24.375
It doesn't look like the
young man's mind is here.

00:05:24.375 --> 00:05:26.208
But he's not dead.

00:05:26.208 --> 00:05:27.333
Listen.

00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:32.792
The boy wasn't protecting himself,
but you, little one.

00:05:32.792 --> 00:05:36.625
So he'll be back one day.
That's what I think.

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:41.292
Probably when you need him the most.

00:05:49.875 --> 00:05:52.375
So you see, Eldrie.

00:05:52.375 --> 00:05:55.542
We can look after one young man.

00:06:04.667 --> 00:06:07.625
All right. Wait a moment, okay?

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.458
Kirito.

00:06:22.458 --> 00:06:28.083
Even though your heart has
been lost since that battle,

00:06:28.083 --> 00:06:32.583
you still tried to protect me
from Uncle's sword technique.

00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:36.500
What do you think of me?

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.833
What do I think of Kirito?

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:44.500
No. I'm only a created being.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.625
Who continues to occupy Alice Zuberg's body.

00:06:47.625 --> 00:06:49.667
A puppet who exists to fight.

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:55.125
I'm not allowed the luxury of feeling anything
other than the intent to fight.

00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:57.958
But maybe...

00:06:57.958 --> 00:07:03.292
...it's because I've been suppressing my
feelings that you can't hear my voice.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:11.417
If I were to unleash all of my
willpower at this moment,

00:07:11.417 --> 00:07:13.625
would you respond?

00:07:20.917 --> 00:07:22.792
U-Um...

00:07:22.792 --> 00:07:26.000
W-We've brought your dinner, Lady Knight.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.042
Thank you. I appreciate it.

00:07:29.042 --> 00:07:32.208
U-Um, it's bread and something to drink.

00:07:32.208 --> 00:07:35.250
You don't have to be afraid.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:39.792
Are you two from the North Centoria
Imperial Swordcraft Academy?

00:07:39.792 --> 00:07:45.333
Yes! I'm Primary Trainee Tiese Schtrinen
of the Human Guardian Army Supply Corps.

00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:49.208
Primary Trainee Ronie Arabel, of the same.

00:07:49.208 --> 00:07:51.875
You don't have to be so formal.

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:55.458
Here, I'm just another
swordsman, nothing more.

00:07:55.458 --> 00:07:57.917
Please call me Alice.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.542
What's the matter?

00:08:00.542 --> 00:08:02.542
O-Oh, it's nothing.

00:08:02.542 --> 00:08:07.333
It's just that you seem so different
from when we met you at the academy.

00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:09.875
You... think so?

00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:13.208
Anyway, is there something you wanted?

00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:14.667
Yes.

00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:23.417
Um, Lady Kni-- Lady Alice, we heard that
you arrived with a dark-haired young man.

00:08:23.417 --> 00:08:28.083
And we were wondering
if he might be someone we know.

00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:29.292
So we thought...

00:08:29.292 --> 00:08:31.750
Oh, yeah. That's right.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:35.292
You two were friends with Kirito
at the academy, weren't you?

00:08:35.292 --> 00:08:37.292
So it is Kirito-<i>senpai</i>!

00:08:37.292 --> 00:08:39.875
Then Eugeo-<i>senpai </i>must...

00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:45.208
This might be too harsh for you to bear.

00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:51.458
But I have faith, that as Kirito's,
as well as Eugeo's juniors,

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:53.792
you're surely capable of accepting it.

00:09:39.042 --> 00:09:41.750
I just... heard...

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.375
...Eugeo-<i>senpai</i>'s voice.

00:09:44.375 --> 00:09:50.708
He said, "Don't cry. I'll always be here."

00:09:57.708 --> 00:10:00.708
Did you two have feelings
for Kirito and Eugeo--?

00:10:00.708 --> 00:10:04.208
That's not it! I... I'm...

00:10:04.208 --> 00:10:10.625
Lady Alice, you know the Taboo Kirito-<i>senpai</i>
and Eugeo-<i>senpai </i>violated, don't you?

00:10:10.625 --> 00:10:16.500
Yes. I was told they killed another student.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:21.333
How about what led them to break that Taboo?

00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:24.208
No, not that much.

00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:30.583
Kirito-<i>senpai </i>and Eugeo-<i>senpai</i>
raised their swords to save us.

00:10:30.583 --> 00:10:33.208
If only we'd been a little wiser,

00:10:33.208 --> 00:10:39.167
they wouldn't have fought the Church
to change the law, and no one would've died.

00:10:39.167 --> 00:10:44.708
We've committed an irreparable crime!

00:10:44.708 --> 00:10:46.750
That's why...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.708
...no matter what happens, we can't ever...

00:10:50.792 --> 00:10:53.375
...admit we're in love with them!

00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:03.000
No, you're wrong about that.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.250
You've committed no crime.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.583
Lady Alice, you...

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:10.750
You're an esteemed Integrity Knight,
Lady Alice, so you can't understand!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:16.250
Our bodies were played with,
and our pride has been tainted by sin!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.958
The body is nothing more
than a vessel for your heart.

00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:23.917
The heart... the soul is the
only thing that truly exists.

00:11:23.917 --> 00:11:26.375
And what determines the nature of your soul...

00:11:26.375 --> 00:11:28.375
...is you alone.

00:11:30.083 --> 00:11:31.708
I know I can do it.

00:11:39.083 --> 00:11:41.958
Just like how Kirito showed me.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:57.958
You see?

00:11:57.958 --> 00:12:02.125
Your body and appearance
merely follow your heart.

00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:04.625
Your heart can't be tainted by anyone.

00:12:04.625 --> 00:12:10.292
I was born in a village in the hinterlands,
and I should've grown up to be like this.

00:12:10.292 --> 00:12:14.583
But when I was 11,
I was taken away as a criminal,

00:12:14.583 --> 00:12:18.083
my memories were erased by an art technique
and I became an Integrity Knight.

00:12:18.083 --> 00:12:20.833
There were times when I cursed such a fate.

00:12:20.833 --> 00:12:21.833
But...

00:12:21.833 --> 00:12:27.125
Kirito taught me that there was something
that I could do... that I should do.

00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:29.333
And that's why I'll never hesitate again.

00:12:29.333 --> 00:12:33.500
I've decided to accept myself
as I am and move on.

00:12:36.833 --> 00:12:43.875
I'm sure there's a wide, long, and
straight path meant only for you, too.

00:12:56.875 --> 00:12:58.000
Yo.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.958
Uncle. Good morning.

00:13:02.417 --> 00:13:05.167
About where we're going to put that young man.

00:13:05.167 --> 00:13:07.125
If you want, I can ask the rearguard unit--

00:13:07.125 --> 00:13:08.125
No.

00:13:08.125 --> 00:13:09.458
It's fine.

00:13:09.458 --> 00:13:13.375
I met his former pages from the academy,

00:13:13.375 --> 00:13:16.458
and asked them to look after him
once the battle begins.

00:13:16.458 --> 00:13:20.708
Oh? That's good to hear.
So how is that black-haired boy?

00:13:20.708 --> 00:13:25.958
Did he react in any way, coming into
contact with people from his past?

00:13:25.958 --> 00:13:27.500
I see.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:33.917
To be honest, I can't help but feel that he'll be
the one to set the course of the coming battle.

00:13:33.917 --> 00:13:34.833
What?

00:13:34.833 --> 00:13:37.667
Even if he had help from you and his partner,

00:13:37.667 --> 00:13:41.708
defeating the prime senator
and the pontifex was an incredible feat.

00:13:41.708 --> 00:13:46.792
I'm not sure if I'd be a match
for the intensity of his willpower.

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:48.542
That can't be.

00:13:48.542 --> 00:13:52.083
When our willpower clashed
yesterday, I definitely felt it.

00:13:52.083 --> 00:13:57.833
That boy has the same amount as, or even
more experience in actual combat than me.

00:13:57.833 --> 00:14:01.625
What do you mean by actual combat?

00:14:01.625 --> 00:14:05.958
Just what I said. A fight for life.

00:14:05.958 --> 00:14:10.208
The Taboo Index prohibits
any battles to the death.

00:14:10.208 --> 00:14:12.917
So where did that boy gain
that kind of experience?

00:14:12.917 --> 00:14:14.917
Uncle, Kirito's actually--

00:14:14.917 --> 00:14:16.792
My lord.

00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:19.083
It's almost time for the war council.

00:14:19.083 --> 00:14:20.667
Lady Fanatio.

00:14:28.042 --> 00:14:31.375
Lady Fanatio... with makeup on?

00:14:31.375 --> 00:14:33.250
It's been a long time, Alice.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:35.125
I'm glad you're well.

00:14:35.125 --> 00:14:37.333
She sounds... feminine?

00:14:37.333 --> 00:14:39.292
I-It's been a long time.

00:14:39.292 --> 00:14:43.333
Hey, Alice, I hear you brought
that black-haired boy with you.

00:14:43.333 --> 00:14:44.333
Uh, yes.

00:14:44.333 --> 00:14:45.208
I see.

00:14:45.208 --> 00:14:49.375
Then could I see him briefly
after the war council?

00:14:49.375 --> 00:14:50.625
Why?

00:14:50.625 --> 00:14:53.167
I just want to thank him.

00:14:53.167 --> 00:14:53.917
Thank him?

00:14:53.917 --> 00:14:54.917
Yes.

00:14:54.917 --> 00:14:58.000
For fighting and defeating me.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:02.583
In all my years as an Integrity Knight,
that boy is the only one

00:15:02.583 --> 00:15:06.708
who fought me all-out,
even though he knew I was a woman.

00:15:06.708 --> 00:15:09.083
What do you mean...?

00:15:09.083 --> 00:15:14.333
Whenever a man fights me, there's always
a slight difference in his swordplay.

00:15:14.333 --> 00:15:17.875
When I realized that,
I hid my face with a helmet

00:15:17.875 --> 00:15:21.542
and mastered the art of continuous attacks
to prevent opponents from getting close.

00:15:21.542 --> 00:15:26.833
But that was only because I was
self-conscious about my own gender.

00:15:26.833 --> 00:15:31.708
That boy saw right through me, and didn't
hold back as he crossed swords with me.

00:15:31.708 --> 00:15:36.250
During my battle with him, I unleashed
all of my sword skills and art techniques,

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:41.000
and when it was over, all my
trivial obsessions had vanished.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:45.167
See? It's no wonder I want
to thank that boy, right?

00:15:45.167 --> 00:15:47.875
Not to mention, I'm also a little annoyed.

00:15:47.875 --> 00:15:52.417
Because when he saw my exposed face,
he didn't find any womanliness in me.

00:15:52.417 --> 00:15:59.167
So I thought I'd try a few things... and maybe
if I do this or that, he might wake up.

00:15:59.167 --> 00:16:03.208
I am grateful for your kind words,
but he's resting in his tent right now.

00:16:03.208 --> 00:16:06.917
I shall pass on your regards to him later.

00:16:06.917 --> 00:16:10.625
Oh, my. I need your permission to see the boy?

00:16:10.625 --> 00:16:14.667
Whenever you asked to meet with
the commander while he was on duty,

00:16:14.667 --> 00:16:17.917
I don't think I ever refused you
due to my personal feelings.

00:16:17.917 --> 00:16:22.583
Surely I don't need your
permission to see Uncle.

00:16:22.583 --> 00:16:26.750
First of all, if you wished
to be beaten up by a male knight,

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.250
shouldn't you have just asked Uncle to do so?

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.167
Oh, but he's exempt.

00:16:31.167 --> 00:16:33.500
Since he's the most powerful
swordsman in the world,

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.500
of course he would go easy on everyone.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.250
Oh, is that right?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:43.667
Whenever he trained with me, Uncle was always
drenched with sweat from going all-out.

00:16:45.292 --> 00:16:48.042
--My lord, is that true?
--Uncle, it's all your fault for--

00:16:48.042 --> 00:16:51.542
Hey! It's time to start the war council.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:59.417
For the last four months,
we've considered all kinds of strategies,

00:16:59.417 --> 00:17:05.250
but have concluded that it will be difficult to
repulse an all-out attack at our current strength.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.292
On our side of the End Mountains,

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:11.333
there's nothing but grassland and rocks
for ten kilors in all directions.

00:17:11.333 --> 00:17:17.000
If they force their way in this far, then we'll
be surrounded and massacred by the enemy.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:19.292
Therefore, we...

00:17:19.292 --> 00:17:25.125
...have no choice but to fight in this narrow
ravine, that's 100-mel wide and 1,000 mel long.

00:17:25.125 --> 00:17:26.792
We'll set up a defensive position here,

00:17:26.792 --> 00:17:30.042
and relentlessly repel the enemy's
advances, and strike them down.

00:17:30.042 --> 00:17:32.208
This will be our basic strategy
throughout this operation.

00:17:32.208 --> 00:17:34.542
Does anyone have any thoughts so far?

00:17:36.708 --> 00:17:39.917
The enemy forces include ogre units
equipped with longbows,

00:17:39.917 --> 00:17:43.542
as well as the even more dangerous
order of the dark mages.

00:17:43.542 --> 00:17:46.167
What are we going to do
about their long-range attacks?

00:17:46.167 --> 00:17:48.583
It will be a risky gamble, but...

00:17:51.333 --> 00:17:54.375
There's no sunlight in that ravine,
even during the day,

00:17:54.375 --> 00:17:56.625
and not a single blade of grass on the ground.

00:17:56.625 --> 00:18:00.042
In other words,
spatial resources are sparse there.

00:18:00.042 --> 00:18:03.417
If we can consume every last bit
of it before the battle starts,

00:18:03.417 --> 00:18:07.500
in theory, the enemy will be unable
to launch any powerful art techniques.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.208
Needless to say, the same is true for us.

00:18:10.208 --> 00:18:14.708
However, we only have 100 or so
sacred arts wielders on our side.

00:18:14.708 --> 00:18:16.292
Should we find ourselves

00:18:16.292 --> 00:18:20.208
exchanging art techniques, the enemy will
be sure to consume far more resources.

00:18:20.208 --> 00:18:23.500
I see. I believe you're right, Vice Commander.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.958
But if the resources are exhausted,

00:18:25.958 --> 00:18:29.875
won't we be unable to restore
the life of the wounded?

00:18:29.875 --> 00:18:32.208
That's why I said it was a gamble.

00:18:32.208 --> 00:18:35.958
We've brought all of our high-level reagents
and healing potions with us.

00:18:35.958 --> 00:18:38.542
If we restrict all art techniques
to healing arts,

00:18:38.542 --> 00:18:43.500
and use our medicines to assist, the reagents
should last for at least three days.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.500
There's one more problem.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.542
Lady Fanatio.

00:18:47.542 --> 00:18:50.583
No matter how sparse Solus
and Terraria's blessings may be,

00:18:50.583 --> 00:18:56.458
there must be a vast amount of resources in
that ravine that have built up over the years.

00:18:56.458 --> 00:19:02.542
Who would be able to deplete that power
in the short time we have before the battle?

00:19:02.542 --> 00:19:06.792
No, there is someone.
Just one who is capable of that.

00:19:06.792 --> 00:19:07.667
Just one?

00:19:07.667 --> 00:19:11.083
That would be you, Alice Synthesis Thirty.

00:19:11.083 --> 00:19:13.750
Perhaps you haven't realized,

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.875
but your power has surpassed that
of any Integrity Knight.

00:19:17.875 --> 00:19:20.458
I'm sure you're capable of wielding it now.

00:19:20.458 --> 00:19:25.083
The true sacred power that can split
the heavens and rupture the earth.

00:19:25.083 --> 00:19:28.708
All right, please look after
Kirito for me, will you?

00:19:28.708 --> 00:19:30.583
Yes, you can count on us.

00:19:30.583 --> 00:19:35.417
Lady Alice, we promise to protect
Kirito, no matter what.

00:19:37.625 --> 00:19:43.125
Kirito, this could be our last goodbye.

00:19:44.083 --> 00:19:45.375
I'll do my best, as well.

00:19:45.375 --> 00:19:49.292
I'm going to burn every last drop
of the life that you gave me.

00:19:49.292 --> 00:19:54.000
So if I should fall, and call your name
with the last of my strength,

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.917
will you stand up
and draw that sword for me?

00:19:56.917 --> 00:20:01.417
If you're awake, it won't matter if the enemy
has thousands, or even tens of thousands.

00:20:01.417 --> 00:20:05.083
Make a miracle happen again
and protect everybody.

00:20:05.083 --> 00:20:06.917
After all, you...

00:20:13.333 --> 00:20:18.333
After all, you defeated Administrator.

00:20:18.333 --> 00:20:20.667
You're the most powerful swordsman of all.

00:20:23.875 --> 00:20:25.208
Lady Alice.

00:20:27.125 --> 00:20:29.000
Let's head out now.

00:20:30.917 --> 00:20:32.292
Eldrie?

00:20:33.542 --> 00:20:35.792
What is it?

00:20:35.792 --> 00:20:39.542
You've served me well until now.

00:20:39.542 --> 00:20:44.417
I was truly blessed to have you by my side.

00:20:44.417 --> 00:20:47.458
You didn't choose a senior male
knight like Sir Deusolbert.

00:20:47.458 --> 00:20:53.208
You wished to be trained by an amateur like me
because you were concerned about my heart.

00:20:53.208 --> 00:20:54.083
Not at all!

00:20:54.083 --> 00:20:56.542
I would never be so insolent.

00:20:56.542 --> 00:21:01.917
It was just because I was so in awe
of your splendid sword skills.

00:21:01.917 --> 00:21:08.292
Thanks to your support, I was able
to walk this dangerous path until today.

00:21:08.292 --> 00:21:09.833
Thank you.

00:21:12.833 --> 00:21:13.917
Lady Alice.

00:21:13.917 --> 00:21:16.042
Why are you speaking in the past tense?

00:21:16.042 --> 00:21:21.250
Why would you imply that your
path is about to end here?

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:25.542
I... I still haven't learned enough from you!

00:21:25.542 --> 00:21:29.250
My sword, my arts...
I'm still nowhere near your level!

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:34.375
I need you to continue training and
guiding me, forever and ever...

00:21:34.375 --> 00:21:38.875
Integrity Knight Eldrie Synthesis Thirty-One!

00:21:38.875 --> 00:21:39.583
Yes...

00:21:39.583 --> 00:21:43.167
Here are my final orders as your mentor.

00:21:43.167 --> 00:21:46.667
Make sure you survive.
Live to see the advent of peace.

00:21:46.667 --> 00:21:48.958
And then, take them back.

00:21:48.958 --> 00:21:52.708
Your true life and your loved one.

00:22:10.333 --> 00:22:12.500
"November 7, 380 HE The Eastern Gate"

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:52.150
Next time: "Battle of the Knights."
